				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">I took a few days or so out to put my application on halt to help out DHoF (my friends guild) get some new members. I feel very at home with this character and its counterparts. I had meant to post this guy as my main before instead of Damey but people didnt listen to me evidently. 
<br />

<br />
Damey Situation: Bard was to settle my skeptism about the EP, I had said I may get rid of bard since sk has been my thing (lets not forgot I kept Hand over Zug and thats because I liked the class) and Kobil said "I'll buy him from you" and said he had a bard before he loved. There were a few items on my wish list for my mage and sk and so I sold him the bard for plat...its as simple as that. 
<br />

<br />
I was told to re-apply as the actual character rather then under Damey's name this time. 
<br />

<br />
Name: Appocolyptic 
<br />
AA's: 74
<br />
Flags: None 
<br />
Keys: HS, OS, Tsserinas, BoT Tower 
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Guild History: 
<br />

<br />
<a href="http://ralloszek.stephans.org/rz/playerhistory.php?player_name=appocolyptic" target="_blank">http://ralloszek.stephans.org/rz/playerhistory.php?player_name=appocolyptic</a> 
<br />

<br />

<br />
KoS issues: none
<br />

<br />
Why I wish to re-apply: I enjoy the guild for the most part and enjoy raiding with you guys. Lets be quite honest I don't like everyone in the guild and I'm sure a bunch don't care for me too much. I had my class before (Nairrwinus -druid) but regrettably sold him and was leveling him at a time when I was able to play 24/7 like some of you now. I no longer have that luxory because I am practically running my dpt at work and I close constantly. I also had the luxory to level with lowbies all the way up to 40s before I soloed partly to 65. There is like no server population and I work all the time so I simply did not have the time to level a character up 1-60s again. So I started "aquiring" the classes I wanted to play either in mid 50s or already in 60s. In a way I'm cheating yes but I have leveled my own characters 1-60s before so in a way I dont see it that way. I also improve the characters much more then they were before. Raveena, Kobil among others leveled theirs up but were not stupid enough to sell them like I did. I was able to switch classes till I found the right ones (mage/sk) simply because I do not take this game as seriously as some of you. Deaths happen, raids wipe, anti's turn pks, pks turn anti, guilds fade etc and so forth but you know shit happens. I can see why Tryz , Bomage (yes we dont get along but you are in this too), Kobil among others are angry enough to critisize me about switching constantly because they helped Zug with epic pieces and key pieces but some of you that lay on the criticism did not help me one solitary bit or group with me for that matter and in other words have no right to criticize me. I hope to start over with some of you and extend my friendship with others. I intend on being the best guildy I can be this time even to those I don't care much for. I hope this cleared up some things as to how my mind has been working lately. Take care of yourselves and happy new year.<div style="vertical-align: bottom"><br /><br /></div></